  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "**DI017 Circular Dependency Hardening**: DI017 now analyzes reachable, flow-aware effective registration graphs, including `TryAdd`, duplicate overrides, `RemoveAll` / `Replace` removal, high-confidence factory requests, keyed inherit-key dependencies, open generics, and registered `IEnumerable<T>` elements while staying silent for opaque or ambiguous paths. | **DI017 Regression Coverage**: Added focused analyzer and performance coverage for factory cycles, keyed inheritance, collection element cycles, open-generic cycles, unreachable wrappers, separate service collections, registration mutation suppression, shadowed `TryAdd`, and larger factory/collection graphs.",
